      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-panorra-api-go-496",
      "display_title": "Issue #496: Add Profile Fields to User Detail API",
      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">RESULT 07/08/26</h2>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">✅ Implementation:  Add Profile Fields to User Detail API</h2>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Extended the current User Detail response with cover image, website, and ordered social links. The legacy <code class=\"notranslate\">?v=0</code> branch remains unchanged.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Route</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-httpspec notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"GET /users/detail\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">GET</span><span class=\"pl-c1\"> /users/detail</span></pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Scope</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The change is inside the existing <code class=\"notranslate\">else</code> branch in <code class=\"notranslate\">UserDetail</code>. It runs only when the request does not use the legacy <code class=\"notranslate\">v=0</code> response.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">No controller or route changes were required.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Profile Query</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The handler queries the authenticated user's profile fields:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"var profile struct {\n    CoverImage *string\n    Website    *string\n}\n\nConfig.DB.Table(&quot;users&quot;).\n    Select(&quot;cover_image, website&quot;).\n    Where(&quot;id = ?&quot;, userData[&quot;user_id&quot;]).\n    Scan(&amp;profile)\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">var</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">profile</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">struct</span> {\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">CoverImage</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">*</span><span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">Website</span>    <span class=\"pl-c1\">*</span><span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"pl-s1\">Config</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">DB</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Table</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"users\"</span>).\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">Select</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"cover_image, website\"</span>).\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">Where</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"id = ?\"</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">userData</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\">\"user_id\"</span>]).\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">Scan</span>(<span class=\"pl-c1\">&amp;</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">profile</span>)</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Both fields are pointers so database <code class=\"notranslate\">NULL</code> values remain JSON <code class=\"notranslate\">null</code>.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Social Links Query</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added a response-only type:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"type userSocialLinkResponse struct {\n    Type string `json:&quot;type&quot;`\n    URL  string `json:&quot;url&quot;`\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">type</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">userSocialLinkResponse</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">struct</span> {\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">Type</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">`json:\"type\"`</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">URL</span>  <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">`json:\"url\"`</span>\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Links are queried by authenticated user ID:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"socialLinks := []userSocialLinkResponse{}\n\nConfig.DB.Table(&quot;user_social_links&quot;).\n    Select(&quot;type, url&quot;).\n    Where(&quot;user_id = ?&quot;, userData[&quot;user_id&quot;]).\n    Order(&quot;position ASC&quot;).\n    Scan(&amp;socialLinks)\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-s1\">socialLinks</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> []<span class=\"pl-smi\">userSocialLinkResponse</span>{}\n\n<span class=\"pl-s1\">Config</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">DB</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Table</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"user_social_links\"</span>).\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">Select</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"type, url\"</span>).\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">Where</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"user_id = ?\"</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">userData</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\">\"user_id\"</span>]).\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">Order</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"position ASC\"</span>).\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">Scan</span>(<span class=\"pl-c1\">&amp;</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">socialLinks</span>)</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Initializing the slice with <code class=\"notranslate\">[]userSocialLinkResponse{}</code> ensures users without links receive <code class=\"notranslate\">[]</code> instead of <code class=\"notranslate\">null</code>.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Response Assignment</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fields are assigned directly:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"userData[&quot;cover_image&quot;] = profile.CoverImage\nuserData[&quot;website&quot;] = profile.Website\nuserData[&quot;social_links&quot;] = socialLinks\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-s1\">userData</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\">\"cover_image\"</span>] <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">profile</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">CoverImage</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s1\">userData</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\">\"website\"</span>] <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">profile</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Website</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s1\">userData</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\">\"social_links\"</span>] <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">socialLinks</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">No helper abstraction was added because these are three simple assignments.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Include Support</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added these values to the current branch's allowed include fields:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"cover_image\nwebsite\nsocial_links\"><pre lang=\"text\" class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">cover_image\nwebsite\nsocial_links\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Example:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-httpspec notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"GET /users/detail?include=cover_image,website,social_links\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">GET</span><span class=\"pl-c1\"> /users/detail?include=cover_image,website,social_links</span></pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Legacy Compatibility</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The following behavior remains unchanged:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">GET /users/detail?v=0</code> response.</li>\n<li>Existing User Detail fields.</li>\n<li>Onboarding response.</li>\n<li>Encrypted response handling.</li>\n<li>Slim RabbitMQ notification.</li>\n<li>Authentication and error response format.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Files Changed</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">src/Action/V1/Users/UserDetail.go</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Verification</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ran:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"go test ./src/Action/V1/Users ./src/Controllers/V1 ./src/Routes/V1\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">go <span class=\"pl-c1\">test</span> ./src/Action/V1/Users ./src/Controllers/V1 ./src/Routes/V1</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Result: pass; packages contain no test files.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Objective</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add cover image, website, and social links to the current User Detail response without changing the legacy slim response.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Route</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-httpspec notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"GET /users/detail\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">GET</span><span class=\"pl-c1\"> /users/detail</span></pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Requirements</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add the new fields only in the current response branch.</li>\n<li>Do not change the legacy <code class=\"notranslate\">?v=0</code> response.</li>\n<li>Return <code class=\"notranslate\">cover_image</code> from <code class=\"notranslate\">users.cover_image</code>.</li>\n<li>Return <code class=\"notranslate\">website</code> from <code class=\"notranslate\">users.website</code>.</li>\n<li>Return social links from <code class=\"notranslate\">user_social_links</code>.</li>\n<li>Order social links by <code class=\"notranslate\">position ASC</code>.</li>\n<li>Return social links as an empty array when the user has no links.</li>\n<li>Expose only <code class=\"notranslate\">type</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">url</code> for each social link.</li>\n<li>Support the new fields through the existing <code class=\"notranslate\">include</code> query:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">cover_image</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">website</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">social_links</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Preserve onboarding, encryption, authentication, RabbitMQ, and existing response behavior.</li>\n<li>Do not introduce a response-shaping helper for three direct assignments.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Response</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;statusCode&quot;: 200,\n  &quot;data&quot;: {\n    &quot;valid&quot;: true,\n    &quot;version&quot;: 0,\n    &quot;messages&quot;: &quot;User Detail&quot;,\n    &quot;result&quot;: {\n      &quot;username&quot;: &quot;username&quot;,\n      &quot;cover_image&quot;: &quot;cover.jpg&quot;,\n      &quot;website&quot;: &quot;https://example.com&quot;,\n      &quot;social_links&quot;: [\n        {\n          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;instagram&quot;,\n          &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://instagram.com/username&quot;\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"statusCode\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">200</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"data\"</span>: {\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"valid\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"version\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"messages\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>User Detail<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"result\"</span>: {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"username\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>username<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"cover_image\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>cover.jpg<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"website\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>https://example.com<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"social_links\"</span>: [\n        {\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>instagram<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n          <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"url\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>https://instagram.com/username<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Nullable fields:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;cover_image&quot;: null,\n  &quot;website&quot;: null,\n  &quot;social_links&quot;: []\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"cover_image\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">null</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"website\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">null</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"social_links\"</span>: []\n}</pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Include Example</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-httpspec notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"GET /users/detail?include=cover_image,website,social_links\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">GET</span><span class=\"pl-c1\"> /users/detail?include=cover_image,website,social_links</span></pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Data Sources</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Profile fields:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"SELECT cover_image, website\nFROM users\nWHERE id = :user_id;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span> cover_image, website\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> users\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> id <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> :user_id;</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Social links:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"SELECT type, url\nFROM user_social_links\nWHERE user_id = :user_id\nORDER BY position ASC;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span> type, url\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> user_social_links\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> user_id <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> :user_id\n<span class=\"pl-k\">ORDER BY</span> position <span class=\"pl-k\">ASC</span>;</pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Files</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">src/Action/V1/Users/UserDetail.go</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Verification</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"go test ./src/Action/V1/Users ./src/Controllers/V1 ./src/Routes/V1\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">go <span class=\"pl-c1\">test</span> ./src/Action/V1/Users ./src/Controllers/V1 ./src/Routes/V1</pre></div>",
